-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows April to May and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 46% of normal in January to February and 39% in November to December. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 32% on the middle of the grids. Grid 7400 had its driest year in 1989 at 61%.</p>"}
